===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|legal|lang=en}} A [[judicial]] [[officer]] with limited authority to administer and enforce the [[law]].  A magistrate's court may have jurisdiction in [[civil]] or [[criminal]] cases, or both.
# {{context|Quebec|lang=en}} A [[master's degree]]

